{
"duration": 50.246,
"lines": [
{
"i": 0,
"id": "hook",
"text": "How do you survive... the Undertow?",
"start": 0.35,
"end": 2.094
},
{
"i": 1,
"id": "keep",
"text": "You're the night keeper of a lonely lighthouse, and at midnight, the great lamp goes dark.",
"start": 2.444,
"end": 7.026
},
{
"i": 2,
"id": "sea",
"text": "Then, something crawls out of the sea.",
"start": 7.376,
"end": 9.014
},
{
"i": 3,
"id": "bent",
"text": "It walks on its hands and feet, bent backwards... and its head hangs upside down.",
"start": 10.114,
"end": 14.828
},
{
"i": 4,
"id": "tall",
"text": "When it stands up, it's ten feet tall.",
"start": 15.178,
"end": 17.002
},
{
"i": 5,
"id": "rule",
"text": "Rule number one: it can't touch the light. But in the dark, it's faster than you.",
"start": 17.302,
"end": 21.444
},
{
"i": 6,
"id": "seen",
"text": "And now, it has seen you.",
"start": 21.744,
"end": 22.904
},
{
"i": 7,
"id": "boat",
"text": "Run for your boat? No. The water is where it hunts.",
"start": 24.204,
"end": 26.582
},
{
"i": 8,
"id": "rocks",
"text": "Hide in the rocks? It smells you, and it's on you in seconds.",
"start": 26.882,
"end": 29.753
},
{
"i": 9,
"id": "works",
"text": "Here's what works. Get inside, run to the top, and relight the lamp.",
"start": 30.153,
"end": 33.595
},
{
"i": 10,
"id": "climb",
"text": "It climbs the tower... and presses its face against the glass.",
"start": 34.045,
"end": 37.441
},
{
"i": 11,
"id": "next",
"text": "Right next to you.",
"start": 37.741,
"end": 38.73
},
{
"i": 12,
"id": "stay",
"text": "Stay. In. The light.",
"start": 40.23,
"end": 41.317
},
{
"i": 13,
"id": "dawn",
"text": "At sunrise, it lets go, and slides back into the sea.",
"start": 41.817,
"end": 44.841
},
{
"i": 14,
"id": "cta",
"text": "Would you have survived? Follow, because part seven is coming for you.",
"start": 45.241,
"end": 48.646
}
],
